title: SwordPenguin
---

<<declare $got_sword = false>>

<<if $got_sword == false>>
    <<jump SwordPenguin1>>
<<else>>
    <<jump SwordPenguin2>>
<<endif>>
===

title: SwordPenguin1
---
Caden the Penguin: Hey there traveler!
Caden the Penguin: If you are going over there, you're gonna wanna have something to defend yourself with.
Caden the Penguin: Them seals eat guys like us for breakfast.
Caden the Penguin: And those foxes sure are mischievous.
Caden the Penguin: If I were you, I'd find an actual weapon to defend yourself with.
===
title: SwordPenguin2
---
Caden the Penguin: Wow! That's a cool looking sword you got there!
Caden the Penguin: Those animals got nothing on you now.
Caden the Penguin: Good luck!
===

title: SlidePenguin
---
Aidan the Penguin: Us penguins love sliding on our bellys!
Aidan the Penguin: It's a lot quicker than just waddling around.
Aidan the Penguin: You can belly slide by clicking SHIFT!
Aidan the Penguin: Happy sliding!
===

title: IglooPenguin
---
Jaden the Penguin: Welcome to my humble abode!
Jaden the Penguin: Some tall looking penguins built this and then left it behind.
Jaden the Penguin: It doesn't bother me though because I love the warmth!
Jaden the Penguin: All my friends make fun of me for it, but in another life I definitely lived in a warm climate.
Jaden the Penguin: Being inside this igloo is the closes I'll get to it.
Jaden the Penguin: I hate living in this icy nightmare. Too cold and too many inconviences, just like those ice spikes.
Jaden the Penguin: They always get in the way of the path, the only way to get rid of 'em is to push them with something.
Jaden the Penguin: Or else, it'll poke ya to death.
Jaden the Penguin: I use my trusty shield to do so, but since I found this place, I have no need for it anymore!
===

title: Igloo2Penguin
---
Hayden the Penguin: Honk!... I mean... hey!
Hayden the Penguin: Those animals out there sure are scary.
Hayden the Penguin: I'm not a fighter, so instead I just stay camped out here in this big snow dome.
Hayden the Penguin: You sure seem like a brave fighter, so I'll leave it to you to take care of them.
===

title: Igloo3Penguin
---
Jared the Penguin: You made it to the end of the demo!
Jared the Penguin: Thanks for playing it! I heard the developer worked really hard on this world.
Jared the Penguin: Hopefully there will be more to come in the future!
===

title: TrappedPenguin
---
<<declare $gave_snowballs = false>>

<<if $gave_snowballs == false>>
    <<jump TrappedPenguin1>>
<<else>>
    <<jump TrappedPenguin2>>
<<endif>>
===


title: TrappedPenguin1
---
Aiden the Penguin: Thank god you're hear. I got trapped inside these ice rocks.
Aiden the Penguin: I don't know what I would've done without you.
Aiden the Penguin: Here, take these snowballs as a gift for getting me out! {GiveSnowballs()}
Aiden the Penguin: Me trying to throw them is sadder than us penguins trying to fly.
<<set $gave_snowballs = true>>
===

title: TrappedPenguin2
---
Aiden the Penguin: Now that I'm free, I can finally expore this beautiful world.
===


title: SnowballPenguin
---

<<declare $intro_played = false>>
<<declare $got_snowballs = false>>

<<if $intro_played == false && $got_snowballs == false>>
    <<jump SnowballPenguinIntro>>
<<elseif $got_snowballs == false>>
    <<jump SnowballPenguinCheckChest>>
<<elseif HasSnowballs()>>
    <<jump SnowballPenguinObserve>>
<<else>>
    <<jump SnowballPenguinGiveSnowballs>>
<<endif>>
===

title: SnowballPenguinIntro
---
Brayden the Penguin: I love throwing these snowballs!
Brayden the Penguin: You'd be surpised the things you can break with a snowball.
Brayden the Penguin: Sometimes I like to throw it at some of the other guys.
Brayden the Penguin: They really get annoyed at for it. Maybe it's why I'm trapped here all by myself.
Brayden the Penguin: Whatever. I think it's fun!
<<set $intro_played = true>>
===

title: SnowballPenguinCheckChest
---
Brayden the Penguin: You should try to get some snowballs of your own.
Brayden the Penguin: That shiny chest behind you might help you out.
===

title: SnowballPenguinObserve
---
Brayden the Penguin: Hey, nice lookin' snowballs.
Brayden the Penguin: Throw those bad boys and see what you can hit.
===

title: SnowballPenguinGiveSnowballs
---
Brayden the Penguin: Looks like you ran out of snowballs.
Brayden the Penguin: Don't worry, I got some extra right here, go ahead and take 'em!
Brayden the Penguin: Just come back to me if you need anymore. {GiveSnowballs()}
===